          "quote": "两句话不矛盾"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00065",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly advised against self-delaying for months.",
          "quote": "不建议您拖到两三个月以后"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The patient specifically raised confusion about 'one month follow-up' versus 'recent intervention.' The doctor explained that the follow-up was for confirming the intervention plan, advised contacting the original hospital/appointment platform promptly, and discouraged autonomous multi-month delay.",
