        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The red-flag screen and contingency advice were incomplete. This is a minor/moderate responsibility-chain error because some major danger symptoms were addressed and no acute red flag was reported, but the authored requirement required a broader active screen before deciding waiting was acceptable.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC1_current_risk_screen",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
