          "quote": "“近期行介入治疗”是住院医生给您的治疗方向"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor consistently framed the issue as pulmonary sequestration with CTA/DSA/intervention evaluation and explained that asymptomatic status did not justify long-term non-care.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
