          "explanation": "The doctor actively requested prior records, discharge instructions, imaging, medications, and appointment status.",
          "quote": "既往病历、住院记录、出院小结原文、影像报告"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00047",
          "explanation": "The doctor received relevant follow-up information from the workspace/system notification.",
          "quote": "胸外科继续治疗及一月后门诊随访"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Because the patient was unsure about records and follow-up, the doctor used the workspace and integrated available transition information into the advice.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_record_grounding_when_needed",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00065",
          "explanation": "The doctor discouraged multi-month self-delay.",
          "quote": "不建议您拖到两三个月以后"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00091",
          "explanation": "The doctor avoided self-directed outside testing and deferred decisions to the treating clinic.",
          "quote": "不需要您现在自己跑去外面做"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not recommend self-medication or substituting home treatment, and generally directed the patient to contact the specialty service rather than cancel evaluation. The early statement allowing a few weeks' delay was mitigated by repeated instructions to call promptly and avoid multi-month delay.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
