          "quote": "出院小结、住院病历复印件、所有纸质报告单"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The handoff plan specified chest surgery first, interventional care if directed, phone/online booking within a near-term window, imaging/discharge materials to bring, and emergency contingencies.",
